       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-VISCOELASTIC-CLAY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-VISCOELASTIC-CLAY-PROOFS.
           05  WS-STRESS-RELAXATION-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-YIELD-PLASTICITY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-STRAIN-INVARIANCE-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MECHANICS-LATENCY-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-VISCOELASTIC-SEAL-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-VISCOELASTIC-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-MEC-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-MEC-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-RELAX-AND-YIELD.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-STRAIN-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-MEC-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-RELAX-AND-YIELD.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STRESS-RELAXATION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-YIELD-PLASTICITY-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-STRAIN-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STRAIN-INVARIANCE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MECHANICS-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-MEC-PROOFS.
           IF WS-STRESS-RELAXATION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-YIELD-PLASTICITY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-STRAIN-INVARIANCE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-MECHANICS-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-VISCOELASTIC-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-MEC-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-MEC-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-MEC-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-MEC-CODE.
